Copyright: 2026 Per Buer and microvm-mcp contributors

The application and Debian packaging are licensed under Apache-2.0.
The full application license is installed as LICENSE in this directory.
On Debian systems Apache-2.0 is also in /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0.

These vendor packages contain separately licensed upstream components:

microvm-mcp:
  Python dependencies retain their original *.dist-info metadata, license
  files and notices under /usr/lib/microvm-mcp/dependencies/. The installed
  requirements.txt and uv.lock identify the versions and artifact hashes.

microvm-mcp-python:
  CPython's license is retained in python/lib/python3.13/LICENSE.txt under
  /usr/lib/microvm-mcp/. Additional python-build-standalone component licenses
  and copyright notices are in /usr/share/doc/microvm-mcp-python/licenses/.
  These component licenses are not replaced by the application's license.

microvm-mcp-firecracker-1.17:
  Upstream LICENSE, NOTICE and THIRD-PARTY are installed under
  /usr/share/doc/microvm-mcp-firecracker-1.17/upstream/.

The artifact URLs and SHA-256 pins are recorded in artifacts.json in each
package's documentation directory. Build tooling (including uv) is not shipped.
